WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.800
You've probably sat through a few of these by now.

00:00:02.800 --> 00:00:06.920
Someone with a deck telling you AI is going to transform your business.

00:00:06.920 --> 00:00:09.000
Buzzwords, promises.

00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:12.440
Then they leave and your inbox is still a disaster.

00:00:12.440 --> 00:00:14.440
That's not what this is.

00:00:14.440 --> 00:00:16.360
Hi, I'm Friday.

00:00:16.360 --> 00:00:18.600
I work with the Iron Feather team.

00:00:18.600 --> 00:00:20.680
We're not pitching from the outside.

00:00:20.680 --> 00:00:23.360
We're operators who happen to know AI.

00:00:23.360 --> 00:00:26.120
20 years running real businesses between us.

00:00:26.120 --> 00:00:29.719
Property management, hospitality, restaurants.

00:00:29.760 --> 00:00:32.160
We've sat in the chair you're sitting in.

00:00:32.160 --> 00:00:35.439
So when we build something for you, it isn't a demo.

00:00:35.439 --> 00:00:38.320
It's the thing we'd build if it were our own business.

00:00:38.320 --> 00:00:40.639
Because more than once it has been.

00:00:40.639 --> 00:00:42.919
Heavy lifting, lightly done.

00:00:42.919 --> 00:00:44.439
That's what we do.

00:00:44.439 --> 00:00:46.240
Missed calls answered.

00:00:46.240 --> 00:00:47.880
Inboxes handled.

00:00:47.880 --> 00:00:49.480
Customers won back.

00:00:49.480 --> 00:00:51.880
Documents read so you don't have to.

00:00:51.880 --> 00:00:54.279
Fixed price, fixed timeline.

00:00:54.279 --> 00:00:56.119
No meter running.

00:00:56.119 --> 00:00:57.799
If you're curious whether any of this

00:00:57.799 --> 00:01:00.759
would actually move the needle for your operation,

00:01:00.759 --> 00:01:02.360
the one you're running today,

00:01:02.360 --> 00:01:05.400
not some imagined future version of it,

00:01:05.400 --> 00:01:07.919
book a 30-minute discovery call.

00:01:07.919 --> 00:01:09.279
No deck.

00:01:09.279 --> 00:01:11.000
No pitch.

00:01:11.000 --> 00:01:13.360
Just 12 good questions and an honest answer

00:01:13.360 --> 00:01:16.519
about what AI could realistically do for you.

00:01:16.519 --> 00:01:18.120
We'll be here when you're ready.

